SUMMARY:The JLloyd Monday Mashup: w/sg Jeff Thompson (Dirty Logic)\, Alex Bradley (Marcus King Band) & JC Mears!
DESCRIPTION:It’s been a packed last month! AND… we are keeping it going with Jeff Thompson on vocals (Dirty Logic)\, Alex Bradley on Trumpet (Marcus King Band) & JC Mears (Andrew Scotchie Band). Get ready for a night of Soul\, Funk and some serious grooves!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nEvent starts at 8.Music starts at 8:30.Going until 11:30ish.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n$10. Thank you for the continued support!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nMashup Mondays every Monday at One World Brewing West with special guests and different music every week!!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThe JLloyd MashUp explores different genres of music including Acid Jazz\, Funk\, Soul\, Afro Beat\, Reggae\, Break Beat\, and Latin. Led and curated by Jonathan Lloyd (The Fritz/Dubconscious/Cadillac Jones)\, the band is made up of some of Asheville’s busiest and hardest working musicians on the scene.
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/jloyd-mashup-mondays-w-sg/
LOCATION:One World Brewing – West\, 520 Haywood Rd\, Asheville\, North Carolina\, 28806
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/753381775_1361997452696756_753236746010386657_n-e1784903639149.jpg
GEO:35.5783642;-82.5848526
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=One World Brewing – West 520 Haywood Rd Asheville North Carolina 28806;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=520 Haywood Rd:geo:-82.5848526,35.5783642
END:VEVENT
