SUMMARY:COMING AUGUST 1st | An Evening With…. ZOSO: The Ultimate Led Zeppelin Experience
DESCRIPTION:Saturday August 1\, 2026 | GATES: 6:00PM | SHOW: 7:00PM | $31 adv. Event Details and Tickets \n  \n\nelebrating 31 years of touring in 2026\, Zoso has become one of the most iconic and respected Led Zeppelin tribute experiences in the world\, having played over 4\,900 shows in all 50 states and internationally. Known for their unparalleled dedication to faithfully recreating the legendary band’s live performances\, Zoso has earned accolades from both critics and fans alike. \nZoso’s live performances focus on the raw energy and intricate musicality of Led Zeppelin’s best-known hits and deeper tracks\, with a particular emphasis on recreating their live show experience. The band’s commitment to authenticity has earned them praise from major outlets\, with the LA Times calling them “head and shoulders above all other Led Zeppelin tributes\,” and the St. Petersburg Times describing them as “the most exacting of all the Led Zeppelin tributes.” \n  \nFounded in 2005\, Pisgah is known for producing some of the most sought after craft ales in Western North Carolina. Pisgah Brewing Company currently operates an indoor taproom and an open air outdoor bar in the summer and fall months with live music several days a week. Check out our upcoming schedule at pisgahbrewing.com/events
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/coming-friday-august-22nd-an-evening-with-zoso-the-ultimate-led-zeppelin-experience-2/2026-07-28/
LOCATION:Pisgah Brewing Company Black Mountain\, 2948 US-70\, Black Mountain\, NC\, 28711
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Black Mountain,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/658961107_1418214076999431_3041049820534545691_n-e1775164247142.jpg
GEO:35.6068069;-82.3568213
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Pisgah Brewing Company Black Mountain 2948 US-70 Black Mountain NC 28711;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=2948 US-70:geo:-82.3568213,35.6068069
END:VEVENT
