SUMMARY:Black Mountain Bluegrass Jam "unplugged"
DESCRIPTION:Pisgah Brewing’s unplugged bluegrass jam is hosted on Tuesdays at 6pm in the taproom. Bring your instruments and join in. It’ll be held on the patio on nicer days.\nAll levels welcome.\n\n\nFounded in 2005\, Pisgah is known for producing some of the most sought after craft ales in Western North Carolina. Pisgah Brewing Company currently operates the new indoor taproom & deli\, with live music several days a week\, plus an open air outdoor bar in the summer and fall months. Check out our upcoming schedule at pisgahbrewing.com/events
